Hi,
  The HP CD4e USB CDwriter that uses the Shuttle_USBAT driver has
  stopped working.  Using git-bisect leads to a merge commit, where
  both branches leading into the merge are OK.

The commit in question is 7c8d20d40f29e7c08332d406d7a65678dece4627

This makes no sense to me.  Looking at the changes I can't see
anything that would break usbat.  Do you have any ideas?
